OL,5,G1800 Sicily: Jewel of the Med
OL,6,     FSpectacular Sicily, the largest
OL,7,     Fisland in the Med, is home to
OL,8,     Fvolcano Mount Etna and stunning
OL,9,     Fcoastlines. Roman, Greek and Arab
OL,10,     Finfluences are all felt, through
OL,11,     Fart, architecture and food.
